{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/pulls/493","id":5099615138,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTKYpjM8AAAABL_Xzog","html_url":"https://github.com/fum-lab/fum/pull/493","diff_url":"https://github.com/fum-lab/fum/pull/493.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/fum-lab/fum/pull/493.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/issues/493","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/pulls/493/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/pulls/493/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/issues/493/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/statuses/46ef3de792e191ecc083dcffe22669378ffb33a6","number":493,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Закрепить локальные связи агентов и явные исключения legacy-процедур","user":{"login":"Roman-Kerimov","id":22149544,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTQ5NTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22149544?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov","html_url":"https://github.com/Roman-Kerimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Уточняет действующие правила: полезная локальность имеет приоритет при выборе данных и связей, соседи могут обмениваться готовыми результатами и консультациями без ручного посредничества ROOT; владение и управление остаются у ответственного агента. Явное адресное исключение человека/уполномоченного родителя не отменяется общей legacy-командой; исключённые проверки остаются UNKNOWN.\n\nПринимается узкая ветка 46ef3de792e191ecc083dcffe22669378ffb33a6: AGENTS.md, тема 000028, синхронный инвентарь и семь собственных пар Журнала. Package.swift и проверяющий код из прежней широкой ветки не включены. Коррекция старых ошибочных author/committer сохранена add-only; история не переписана.\n\nОграниченный обзор: сохранены все 236 идентификаторов правил, изменены только четыре адресные записи инвентаря; хэш темы совпадает, исходный literal маршрутизатора сохранён. Проверены 62 локальные ссылки по Git-дереву и diff --check. Python, полный ROOT JSONL, валидатор и общий профиль исключены/UNKNOWN, а не GREEN. Фактическая доставка и применение общего поведения всеми агентами проверяются отдельно.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-31T16:54:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T16:56:02Z","closed_at":"2026-10-31T16:56:01Z","merged_at":"2026-10-31T16:56:01Z","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"fum-lab:fum-lab/fum/pravila/lokaljnyie-svyazi-i-isklyucheniya/master","ref":"fum-lab/fum/pravila/lokaljnyie-svyazi-i-isklyucheniya/master","repo":{"id":1285958028,"node_id":"R_kgDOTKYpjA","name":"fum","full_name":"fum-lab/fum","owner":{"login":"fum-lab","id":298648657,"node_id":"O_kgDOEc0EUQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/298648657?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fum-lab","html_url":"https://github.com/fum-lab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fum-lab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fum-lab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fum-lab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.c